{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122040","id":4189447358,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc75teS-","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122040","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122040.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122040.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122040","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122040/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122040/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122040/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/53d986f0fe544f2944426668d91896c582eeebfc","number":122040,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add halfway-point test for Math::snapped with negative step","user":{"login":"NhatMinh2225","id":229365921,"node_id":"U_kgDODavYoQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/229365921?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NhatMinh2225","html_url":"https://github.com/NhatMinh2225","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NhatMinh2225/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NhatMinh2225/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NhatMinh2225/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NhatMinh2225/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NhatMinh2225/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NhatMinh2225/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NhatMinh2225/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NhatMinh2225/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NhatMinh2225/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nAdds a test-only check for `Math::snapped()` at an exact halfway point,\r\nshowing that the sign of `p_step` flips which multiple ties resolve to:\r\n- `snapped(5.0, 2.0)  == 6.0` (positive step → resolves to the larger multiple)\r\n- `snapped(5.0, -2.0) == 4.0` (negative step → resolves to the smaller multiple)\r\n\r\nNo production code changed.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThe existing tests check negative `p_step` in isolation, but never pair it\r\nwith the same `p_value` against a positive `p_step` of equal magnitude.\r\nThis PR adds that direct comparison, which is what makes the tie-breaking\r\nasymmetry visible — something the current suite doesn't cover.\r\n\r\nAI Disclosure: I'm using AI for grammar correctness and formatting for the description.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2231593685,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMjMxNTkzNjg1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:tests","name":"topic:tests","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","follow